# Retained requirement and commissioned research; not action acceptance.
direction: down
classes: {
  start: {style: {fill: "#25364B"; font-color: "#FFFFFF"; bold: true; stroke-width: 3}}
}
Contract: "Start here · Preserve selected location and copy\nRoughly 1500-byte file and constrained app\nBoth controls · prompt-free reads · bounded acknowledgment" {class: start}
Relative: "Measured · local relative access works\nDirectory handle + name reaches long items\nPrompt / policy / general parity remain obligations"
Boundary: "Measured · tested native handoff fails\nWitness delivered at 1023 bytes; fails at 1024\nPrior survey found no admitted opener route"
Retained: "Selected · original requirement retained\nAntony requested wider application research\nNo refusal / shortening / alternate-copy loss adopted"
SurveyA: "Independent survey A · real application workflows\nNormal + over-limit paths through operations\nPrimary sources · successes and limits"
SurveyB: "Independent survey B · same research brief\nSeparate source corpus · do not read A\nFile / build / archive / remote contexts"
Synthesis: "Synthesis · union evidence and attack mechanisms\nExpose contradictions and correlated sources\nTrace full-path reconstruction and receivers"
Design: "Returned design · supported route still required\nOriginal bytes / native facts / exact copy / receipts\nFinal review before consumers and planning"
Contract -> Relative: "1 · inspect"
Relative -> Boundary: "2 · handoff gap"
Boundary -> Retained: "3 · human decision"
Retained -> SurveyA: "commissioned"
Retained -> SurveyB: "independent"
SurveyA -> Synthesis
SurveyB -> Synthesis
Synthesis -> Design: "evidence before route"
